 a condition without which social peace and stability, general respect for the law and unity of the sentiment and of action for national objects, can never prevail in Ireland" - B[awdinton? 7 Bis...?]. -- Includes contents. -- Includes bibliographical references. -- Includes appendix. -- Includes publications by the author.</dc:description><dc:identifier>http://opac.oireachtas.ie/Data/Library3/Library3/DCT133002.pdf</dc:identifier><dc:publisher>London Rivingtons</dc:publisher><dc:language>en</dc:language><dc:source>The Oireachtas Library &amp; Research Service</dc:source><dc:subject>Church of Ireland -- History.</dc:subject><dc:subject>Church of Ireland -- Establishment and disestablishment.</dc:subject><dc:title>Facts respecting the present state of the Church in Ireland Pamphlets</dc:title><dc:type>InteractiveResource</dc:type><dc:type>Software</dc:type><dc:type>software, multimedia</dc:type><dcterms:spatial>London</dcterms:spatial><edm:europeanaProxy>false</edm:europeanaProxy><ore:proxyFor rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/15416/Data_Library3_Library3_DCT133002_pdf"/><ore:proxyIn rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/provider/15416/Data_Library3_Library3_DCT133002_pdf"/><edm:type>TEXT</edm:type></ore:Proxy><ore:Proxy rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/proxy/europeana/15416/Data_Library3_Library3_DCT133002_pdf"><dc:date rdf:resource="#1867"></dc:date><edm:europeanaProxy>true</edm:europeanaProxy><edm:year>1867</edm:year><ore:proxyFor rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/15416/Data_Library3_Library3_DCT133002_pdf"/><ore:proxyIn rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/europeana/15416/Data_Library3_Library3_DCT133002_pdf"/><edm:type>TEXT</edm:type></ore:Proxy><edm:EuropeanaAggregation rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/europeana/15416/Data_Library3_Library3_DCT133002_pdf"><edm:aggregatedCHO rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/15416/Data_Library3_Library3_DCT133002_pdf"/><edm:datasetName>15416_L_IE_IMC_oire